    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d674">

                <pb facs="0654" n="488" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg488"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Swenson to the
                            Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 200</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1901-04-08">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 8, 1901</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Your dispatch of the 26th ultimo, with
                    enclosed amended draft of a convention for an eventual cession of the Danish
                    West Indies to the United States, reached me Saturday, April 6.</p>
                <p>On the 8th instant, I addressed a note to the Minister of Foreign Affairs, a copy
                    of which is enclosed herewith, formally submitting the new project for the
                    favorable consideration of the Danish Government and communicating to him your
                    dispatch as above in full.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Laurits S. Swenson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>



                <xi:include href="d674-a1.xml" xpointer="d674-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
